{"title":"Planetes","overview":"Haunted by a space flight accident that claimed the life of his beloved wife, Yuri finds himself six years later as part of a team of debris cleaners on a vessel called the Toy Box charged with clearing space junk from space flight paths. The team consists of Hachimaki, a hot shot debris-man with a sailor's affinity for the orbital ocean; Fee, a chain-smoking tomboy beauty with an abrasive edge; and Pops, a veteran orbital mechanic whose avuncular presence soothes the stress of the job.\n\n(Source: TOKYOPOP) \n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*","year":1999,"status":"ended","genres":["Award Winning","Drama","Psychological","Romance","Sci-Fi","Seinen","Slice of Life","Tragedy"],"rating":8.2,"seriesType":"manga","metadata":{"images":[{"coverType":"poster","url":"/demo/MediaCover/2c9cf41f-399f-85a8-9b04-e36bab6d62bd/poster-4582fcda90.jpg","remoteUrl":"https://images.mangabaka.dev/2/b/6/1/1/3/0/a/be5f/4105/99ae/ad199951e03b"}],"creators":[{"name":"Makoto Yukimura","roles":["storyAndArt"]}],"externalLinks":[{"name":"MangaBaka","externalId":"13170","url":"https://mangabaka.org/manga/13170/Planetes","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"12935","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/12935/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"AniList","externalId":"30481","url":"https://anilist.co/manga/30481","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Wikipedia","externalId":"プラネテス","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%97%E3%83%A9%E3%83%8D%E3%83%86%E3%82%B9","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Kitsu","externalId":"1091","url":"https://kitsu.io/manga/1091","relationshipType":1},{"name":"MangaDB","externalId":"5047","url":"https://mangadb.org/series/5047","relationshipType":1},{"name":"MangaDex","externalId":"3be16cf9-fe5c-431e-b528-98551d3d3bb0","url":"https://mangadex.org/title/3be16cf9-fe5c-431e-b528-98551d3d3bb0","relationshipType":1},{"name":"MyAnimeList","externalId":"481","url":"https://myanimelist.net/manga/481","relationshipType":1},{